/**
  @page ci-index Continuous integration
  @brief Branch status, workflow runs and CI reports.

  This index reads the public GitHub Actions API when refreshed. Select develop
  or master to inspect the latest branch commit. A result from an older commit
  is identified explicitly. GitHub remains the source of job logs, artifacts
  and generated reports.

  @section ci-status Current status

  Status loads in the browser. JavaScript and access to api.github.com are
  required. <a href="https://github.com/cbritopacheco/rodin/actions">Open GitHub Actions</a>.

  Refresh is manual to limit public API requests. GitHub's unauthenticated API
  rate limit may temporarily prevent updates; the direct workflow links remain
  usable. No credentials are stored in this page.
*/
